{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"느낌표 붙이기","desc":"<p>문자열 끝에 <code>\"!\"</code>를 붙인 새 문자열을 돌려주는 함수 <code>add_exclaim(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def add_exclaim(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def add_exclaim(s):\n    return s + \"!\"\n","hint":"<p>문자열끼리는 <code>+</code>로 이어 붙여요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"add_exclaim(\"hi\")","expected":"hi!","visible":true},{"call":"add_exclaim(\"\")","expected":"!","visible":true},{"call":"add_exclaim(\"wow\")","expected":"wow!","visible":false},{"call":"add_exclaim(\"a b\")","expected":"a b!","visible":false}],"id":"py-301"}